    <item>
      <title>EA-IRMS</title>
      <link>https://Colombo-Manuel.github.io/services/irms/ea-irms/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://Colombo-Manuel.github.io/services/irms/ea-irms/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Our Elemental Analyzer-IRMS (Costech ECS 4010 CHNS-O &amp;amp; DeltaV IRMS) is optimized for stable carbon and nitrogen isotopic analyses (δ¹³C and δ¹⁵N) in solid matrices. We also perform %OC (%C) and %N analysis. Services include C &amp;amp; N in solids, tinning, acid fumigation, and difficult sample processing. &lt;em&gt;Enriched samples are not currently accepted&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please fill out the sample submission form&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#34;text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;a href=&#34;https://Colombo-Manuel.github.io/services/irms/ea_sampleinfo.xlsx&#34; style=&#34;background-color: #007bff; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block;&#34;&gt;Download VIMS IRMS Sample Submission form&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;layout-wrapper&#34;&gt;
  &lt;!-- Left side: The Picture --&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;image-container&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;https://Colombo-Manuel.github.io/services/irms/ea.png&#34; alt=&#34;EA-IRMS Setup&#34;&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;!-- Right side: The Fancy Table --&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;table-container fancy-table&#34;&gt;
    &lt;table&gt;
      &lt;thead&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Service&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;Internal Cost&lt;/th&gt;
          &lt;th&gt;External Cost&lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;/thead&gt;
      &lt;tbody&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;C &amp; N in solids&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;$9.25&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;$10.92&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Tinning samples&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;$5.00&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;$5.90&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Difficult samples&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;$3.00&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;$3.54&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;Acid fumigation&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;$2.25&lt;/td&gt;
          &lt;td&gt;$2.66&lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
      &lt;/tbody&gt;
    &lt;/table&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For inquiries, please contact &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.vims.edu/about/directory/staff/timmerman-a.php&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Dr. Amanda Timmerman&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
